    kind: work_item  # 1478
    title: "haskell zero-arg IO actions in INFIX positions (bind, reverse-bind, fmap, applicative) still emit no call edge: 63 catalogued sites, excluded on a measured 18-35% wrong-edge rate"  # 1478
